\details{
This dataset includes all categories of state-protected natural areas in Peru:
\itemize{
\item National Parks (Parques Nacionales - PN)
\item National Sanctuaries (Santuarios Nacionales - SN)
\item Historical Sanctuaries (Santuarios Históricos - SH)
\item National Reserves (Reservas Nacionales - RN)
\item Wildlife Refuges (Refugio de Vida Silvestre - RVS)
\item Landscape Reserves (Reservas Paisajísticas - RP)
\item Communal Reserves (Reservas Comunales - RC)
\item Protection Forests (Bosques de Protección - BP)
\item Hunting Reserves (Cotos de Caza - CC)
\item Reserved Zones (Zonas Reservadas - ZR)
\item Regional Conservation Areas (Áreas de Conservación Regional - ACR)
\item Private Conservation Areas (Áreas de Conservación Privada - ACP)
}

The protected areas system in Peru covers various ecosystems including Amazon
rainforest, Andean highlands, coastal deserts, and marine environments. The
dataset reflects the official status as of the version date specified in the
\code{version} variable.

Legal instruments referenced include:
\itemize{
\item LEY: Law passed by Congress
\item D.S.: Decreto Supremo (Supreme Decree)
\item R.M.: Resolución Ministerial (Ministerial Resolution)
\item D.L.: Decreto Ley (Decree Law)
}
